# stellar.toml DRAFT for Quasaria (SEP-1)  --  NOT PUBLISHED
#
# STATUS: draft. SEP-1 requires this file at https://<home-domain>/.well-known/stellar.toml
# (served with CORS "Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *" and content-type text/plain).
# GitHub Pages under https://yogibear1323.github.io/quasaria/ can NOT serve the domain root,
# so publishing needs the OWNER'S OWN DOMAIN. Replace every <OWNER_DOMAIN> below, set the
# issuers' home_domain (set_options) to it, and re-check with a SEP-1 validator.
#
# TESTNET ONLY, UNAUDITED. Every asset below is a testnet asset with no value.
# Mirrors ("mk…") are Quasaria-issued testnet copies of mainnet assets and are NOT redeemable.
# Generated from deployments/testnet.json, deployments/testnet-assets.json and
# frontend/src/config/lending.json.

